WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:09.350
The list rates, deal rules and company details the office works by, and the outside services it connects to.

2
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.500
Settings holds the rules the whole office works by.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.160
List rates: the asking rent per square metre on each level, and the service charge.

4
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:27.090
Deal rules: the usual term, yearly increase and deposit, and the largest discount allowed without approval.

5
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:30.030
Change a value where you need to.

6
00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:34.420
Your company details, printed on every proposal and invoice.

7
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:39.450
Save. The new rules apply from the next offer.

8
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:45.080
Integrations shows the outside services: email, WhatsApp, online payments, e-invoicing, counters and gates.

9
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:54.030
Each card says whether it is connected. The keys are set on the server by your web host, never typed here.

10
00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:59.420
Send a test email to check that messages go out.
